goj(){return"IMPORT SHEET"},
gmV(){return"Google Sheets"},
gog(){return"A spreadsheet opens in the share menu. Open it in Google Sheets or Excel, edit it at home, then download CSV and import it here. Keep the id columns so workouts already on the phone update instead of being copied again. The JSON backup is still the full copy."},
