gve(){return"Day-before reminder"},
gvf(){return"At 21:00 on the evening before a day with workouts."},
gvc(){return"Workout alarm"},
gvd(){return"A signal shortly before a workout you turned on."},
grU(){return"Reminders"},
grT(){return"The evening before a day with workouts, at 21:00, the app says how many sessions are tomorrow and when the first one starts. Your own future workouts and client sessions both count. A separate alarm stays off until you turn it on while choosing the time \u2014 from 10 minutes to 2 hours before. If notifications are off, the app offers to open the phone settings. Both reminders stay on the phone and are not sent anywhere."},
goB(){return"Saved on this phone"},
